{"title": "Berlin Pride festival attack leaves one dead, 17 injured", "summary": "A vehicle mowed down a crowd at the Berlin Pride festival on Saturday, killing one person and injuring 17. The suspect, identified as Abdul Ballout, was shot dead by police during a nationwide manhunt. Police claim Ballout was an Islamist and were seeking his arrest. The attack prompted grief and solidarity with the LGBTQ community. One witness reported seeing Ballout rush at officers with a knife before he was shot.", "summary_points": ["A vehicle mowed down a crowd at the Berlin Pride festival, killing one person.", "17 people were injured in the attack.", "The suspect, Abdul Ballout, was identified by police as an Islamist and was sought for arrest.", "Ballout was shot dead by police during a nationwide manhunt.", "Police claim Ballout had a knife when he was shot."], "title_hi": "बेर्लिन प्राइड मेले में एक वाहन ने सड़क पर चलकर एक लोग की मौत हो गई, 17 लोग घायल हुए", "summary_hi": "बेर्लिन प्राइड मेले में एक वाहन ने सड़क पर चलकर एक लोग की मौत हो गई, 17 लोग घायल हुए। संदिग्ध, अब्दुल बालूत को पुलिस ने आतंकवादी बताया और उनकी गिरफ्तारी की मांग की। पुलिस दावा करते हैं कि बालूत के पास एक खुरदरा था, जिसके लिए उन्हें गोली मारकर मारा गया।", "summary_points_hi": ["बेर्लिन प्राइड मेले में एक वाहन ने सड़क पर चलकर एक लोग की मौत हो गई।", "17 लोग घायल हुए इस हमले में।", "संदिग्ध, अब्दुल बालूत को पुलिस ने आतंकवादी बताया और उनकी गिरफ्तारी की मांग की।", "बालूत को गोली मारकर मारा गया।", "पुलिस दावा करते हैं कि बालूत के पास एक खुरदरा था, जिसके लिए उन्हें गोली मारकर मारा गया।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage largely reported the events without a distinct frame. The focus was on the attack itself and its aftermath.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets framed the funding row as a national-security concern, stressing the foreign-donation angle and the demand for an audit. However, no specific claim or angle was mentioned in the coverage."}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "International", "region": "Worl